review:
Zombie Party
pros:
//fast game with modern day graphics with easy controls that moves from location A to B to C and so on
//good amount of action and special effects
cons:
//some difficult battles/boss battles
//some overpowered enemies
//some enemies have unfair attacks
//could use more powerups and loot
//sometimes too many enemies/hazards
//upgrades require a lot of resources
//collecting resources are a grindfest
//a little repetitive

//good game
Personal Suggested Purchase Price: $0.49 Or Less During Sale
extra notes:
//guns blazing top down survivor with many weapons and weapon mods
//collect coins and loot to upgrade your characters and arsenal of weapons
//jump and blast your way through waves of enemies and enemy bosses
